 "about_text": "Wilding Cran Gallery is a contemporary art gallery in Los Angeles, founded in 2014 by Naomi Wilding and Anthony Cran. Now located at 607 N Western Avenue, the gallery represents a roster of emerging and mid-career artists working across painting, sculpture, photography and mixed media, including Karon Davis, Fran Siegel, Ry Rocklen and Polly Borland. Its program has been featured at major international fairs such as Frieze Los Angeles, Frieze New York, Frieze London, The Armory Show, EXPO Chicago, FELIX Art Fair and NADA New York, and its exhibitions have drawn coverage from outlets including the Los Angeles Times, Artforum, The New York Times and The Guardian. The gallery is a member of the Gallery Association Los Angeles (GALA) and the New Art Dealers Alliance (NADA).",
